[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0010","text":"哇……\n我，飘起来了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0020","text":"……好安静，好美……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0030","text":"……啊，对不起……！\n撞到你了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0040","text":"……“急性子的小星星”……？\n那是在说我吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0050","text":"我，在你眼里也是那样……\n闪闪发光的样子吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0060","text":"啊……\n等等……──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0070","text":"……真乃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0080","text":"……制作人……先生……\n咦，我……睡着了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0090","text":"叫醒你不好意思\n拍摄准备可能要拖一会儿，先回车里吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20100400_01_0100","text":"……好的"}]
